@startuml
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

[*] --> DisabledLocked : Student Enrolled in Course\n(FR-REVIEW-02)

DisabledLocked --> PublishedVisible : Complete At Least One Module\n(FR-REVIEW-02 / UC-11)

state PublishedVisible {
  [*] --> Active
  Active --> Edited : Student Edits Review\n(UC-11 Alt)
  Edited --> Active
}

PublishedVisible --> UnderModeration : Teacher Reports/Disputes Review\n(FR-REVIEW-04 / UC-22 Alt)

UnderModeration --> PublishedVisible : Admin Rejects Dispute (Review Valid)\n[Student is Right]
UnderModeration --> Removed : Admin Confirms Violation\n[Teacher is Right / Policy Breach]

PublishedVisible --> Removed : Admin Direct Removal\n(FR-REVIEW-04 / UC-22)

Removed --> [*]
PublishedVisible --> [*]
@enduml